{
  "title": "Dua e Ne'mul Badal",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Janabe Umme Salma was widowed in medina & in difficulty when she requested the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) for a dua. The Holy prophet (s.a.w.a.) asked her to recite this Dua.\nAs a consequence she became the wife of the Best human being on earth, when there was NO hope of earning respect & a decent living.\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِیْمِ اِنَّا لِلّٰهِ وَ اِنَّا اِلَیْهِ رَاجِعُوْنَ. اَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِیْ فَرَجًا وَّ مَخْرَجًا وَّ ارْزُقْنِیْ خَیْرَ مِنْ حَیْثُ اَحْتَسِبُ وَ مِنْ حَیْثُ لَا اَحْتَسِبُ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ.\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME INNAA LILLAAHE WA INNAAA ELAYHE RAAJE-O’ONA. ALLAAHUMMAJ-A’LNEE FARAJAN WA MAKHRAJAN WAR ZUQNEE KHAYRA MIN HAYSO AHTASEBO WA MIN HAYSO LAA AHTASEBO BE-HAQQE MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN.\nIn the name of Allah, the All-Beneficent, the All-Merciful. Indeed, we belong to Allah and indeed to Him we shall return. O Allah, grant me relief and a way out, and provide for me goodness from where I expect it and from where I do not expect it, by the right of Muhammad and the family of Muhammad."
}
